The city transportation authority utilises the final AI model, which was collaboratively trained using the federation
established between Connectify and GlobalNet for sharing AI infrastructure. The AI model can be used to:
 Optimise traffic signals in real time;
 Suggest alternative routes and detours to drivers;
 Predict traffic congestion and proactively manage traffic flow;
 Optimise public transportation schedules;
 etc.
The federation established between Connectify and GlobalNet can be maintained for future AI/ML collaborations or
released using standardised APIs.

The UAM aircrafts are connected to the 6G network, which provides the following services:
 Sensing services to the UAM aircrafts;
 Communication services to the passengers onboard.
